### Feature LaundryServices — UPDATE PUT / PATCH (SIN AUTH)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/servicios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lavado industrial - Sábanas",
  "description": "Lavado, secado y doblado",
  "price": 6000,
  "billing_unit": "kg",
  "estimated_hours": 24,
  "garment_type_id": 1
}

### PATCH (solo precio)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/servicios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 6200
}
